# The product names of One's ids, in English.
#
# A Frappe module or doctype is named once and never renamed (an id), and the
# desk draws its name through __() wherever it shows it: a module in a list's
# filters, "One Admin Settings" as its form's title. The names people read
# are the products', written as one word ("OneAdmin"), so English carries
# them here as it would a translation. ar.po and de.po say the same names in
# theirs. See docs/WORDING.md.
#
# The other thing here: frappe's own strings that call the product Frappe,
# said as One says them. Only those; frappe's strings naming other things
# (Frappe Cloud, Frappe Mail, "Login with Frappe", its support) stay.
# Nothing else belongs in this file.
